Bind Npc 24421 Zone 11

On greeting
    If quest 317 is started and player has 910131000
        Say "I am Dorana, the fifth [Disciple of Suffering]! You have the [Fourth Certificate of Suffering] hence you are eligible to answer the question. Do you want to hear it?"
        Topic "Accepted" do
            Say "Where can clan members obtain the Key of Honor from Kessarass to be promoted to a knight squad?"
            Topic "Kessaraus Coliseum" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910131000
                    Give 1 of 910132000
            Topic "Kentaraus Coliseum" do
                Transaction
                    Take 1 of 910131000
                    Say "Your answer is incorrect. Your [Fourth Certificate of Suffering] has been consumed as penalty. It is time for me to leave now."
        Topic "Rejected" goto close
    Else if quest 317 is started
        Say "I am Dorana, the fifth [Disciple of Suffering]! I only pose the question to those who bring the [Fourth Certificate of Suffering]."
    Else
        Say ""
